.TH RATASH-PROXY 1 2026-08-01 "Ratash 0.1.1" "Ratash User Commands"
.SH NAME
ratash\-proxy \- List Proxy Groups and select Nodes
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBratash proxy\fR [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIsubcommands\fR>
.SH DESCRIPTION
List Proxy Groups and select Nodes
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.SH SUBCOMMANDS
.TP
ratash\-proxy\-list(1)
List the Nodes exposed by one Proxy Group
.TP
ratash\-proxy\-select(1)
Select one Node in a Proxy Group
